0138:     """Recolor the grey diagonal-chain regions in an orange field to teal.
0139: 
0140:     Input structure
0141:     The input contains only grey pixels and orange pixels.  Grey pixels form
0142:     several 8-connected regions embedded in the orange field.
0143: 
0144:     Rule
0145:     Decompose each grey 8-connected region into 4-connected lobes.  Recolor the
0146:     whole region teal only when it contains a straight diagonal run of at least
0147:     three pixels and those lobes meet only by diagonal corner contacts in a
0148:     non-branching diagonal chain or cycle; a single 4-connected region is
0149:     recolored only when it is a square diagonal staircase.
